@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 10
actor Patient
actor Caregiver
participant ClientP as "Patient Client"
participant ClientC as "Caregiver Client"
participant Gateway
participant "Chain: Revocation" as Chain
participant "Storage" as Storage

== Issue ==
Patient -> ClientP: open consent dashboard (biometric step-up)
ClientP -> Gateway: request delegate(cap scope, expiry)
Gateway -> Gateway: mint capability {aud=CaregiverDID, scope, exp, revHandle, delegationDepth=0}
Gateway -> Chain: record revHandle active
Gateway --> ClientP: deliver capability to share

== Use ==
Caregiver -> ClientC: open record
ClientC -> Gateway: request + capability + DPoP
Gateway -> Chain: check revocation/exp
Gateway -> Storage: fetch CID
Gateway -> Gateway: verify anchor; unwrap key for caregiver
Gateway --> ClientC: ciphertext + aad + wrappedKey
ClientC -> ClientC: decrypt + render
Gateway -> Gateway: audit (actor=caregiver, subject=patient)

== Auto-expire/Revoke ==
ClientP -> Gateway: revoke(revHandle) or wait exp
Gateway -> Chain: set revoked
@enduml
